    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\left(x-\\frac92\\right)^2-\\frac14$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-9x+20&=\\left(x-\\frac92\\right)^2-\\frac{81}{4}+20\\\\x^2-9x+20&=\\left(x-\\frac92\\right)^2-\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$",
